  "retryRules": [
    "Registration pages contiguous offset; exact already-stored page replay succeeds identically, offset skip conflicts.",
    "seal allowed only every descriptor+count+sum+canonical manifest digest proved; same seal replay succeeds.",
    "bytes allowed only sealed same manifest; exact index+SHA+bytes replay succeeds; conflict otherwise.",
    "prepare may repeat and returns stored current stage/cursor; never resets/discards completed normalization.",
    "normalize exact server cursor/raw SHA; exact completed page replay returns its stored acknowledgment, skipped/mismatched cursor conflicts.",
    "complete only after every page and global verification; exact repeat returns same canonical identity.",
    "A lost response never causes fresh upload/root/plan/child identities. Auth is current on every call.",
    "After lost child retirement response, readonly receipt may return conflict/identity_retired without fence timestamp. Retry exactly the journaled explicit retire selector to obtain the durable retired proof; do not infer replacement permission from generic conflict. Captured predecessor frames: ../child-retirement-lost-response/README.md."
  ],
